OL,3,GNEWSABudget negotiations entering
OL,4,A'no-deal territory', says Givan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA budget "ultimatum" offered by the
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland Secretary to the
OL,8,FStormont executive "isn't going to bode
OL,9,Fwell for trying to get a settled
OL,10,Foutcome", Education Minister Paul Givan
OL,11,Fhas warned.
OL,13,FGivan said negotiations with the UK
OL,14,FGovernment were entering "no-deal
OL,15,Fterritory", after Sir Chris Bryant said
OL,16,Fon Thursday there would be no
OL,17,Fimprovement on his #1.5m offer.
OL,19,FSir Chris said there was "no more
OL,20,Fmoney" available and has given
OL,21,Fexecutive parties until next Thursday
OL,22,Fto respond.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
