OL,3,GNEWSABudget negotiations entering
OL,4,A'no-deal territory', says Givan
OL,5,
OL,6,FGivan said the current budget offer
OL,7,Fcould not provide full funding for the
OL,8,FDepartment of Education for this
OL,9,Ffinancial year, even if no other
OL,10,Fdepartment received any money.
